## 6. PG-SC-02 read-back

The split response names each child (`id`), and the tests read each child back through the
existing candidate route `GET /v1/candidates/{candidate_id}` (200) plus the persisted
`proposed_fields_json`, proving `ai_items` traced origin -> child:
`child["ai_items"][0]["name"] == origin["ai_items"][i]["name"]`, with `split_from == candidate.id`.
The origin's `candidate.multi_item` task status is `resolved` in the same committed session.
